          </ul>
          <p class="sg-why__closing">"Solar Gard architectural window film is designed to deliver measurable energy performance in demanding commercial environments," according to Solar Gard by Eastman. For broader energy-efficiency strategies, see our <a href="/benefits/energy-savings/">energy savings window film</a> page. Facilities with security concerns will find additional options on our <a href="/benefits/safety-and-security/">safety and security window film</a> page. For commercial-scale specifications, review our <a href="/applications/office/">commercial office window film</a> page. Explore the full <a href="https://www.solargard.com/en/architectural/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Solar Gard architectural window film</a> lineup.</p>
